  "historyNote": "#7357, eff 9-1-00; amd by #7484, eff 4-28-01; ss and moved by #7723, eff 7-1-02 (from He-C 6910.08); amd by #8377, eff 6-21-05; ss by #9209, INTERIM, eff 7-19-08, EXPIRED: 1-15-09 New. #9363, eff 1-17-09; (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6910) #9474, eff 6-29-09; ss by #10120, eff 5-7-12; amd by #10917, eff 9-1-15; ss by #12221, eff 7-10-17 (from He-C 6910.09); ss by #13063, eff 7-1-20; ss by #13799, eff 10-28-23; ss by #13951, eff 4-30-24",
